{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1002927-survey-from-white-wolf","id":1002927,"title":"Survey from White Wolf","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-14T09:30:40-08:00","id":1002927,"title":"Survey from White Wolf","content":"I just received a request to complete a survey from White Wolf. Has anyone else received this request? Is it legit? I checked the World of Darkness Home Page but nothing is posted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/769-chris-wilson","name":"Chris Wilson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"229"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T12:44:41-08:00","id":1003017,"title":"","content":"It's legit. And yes, I received the same request. Completed it a few minutes ago.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T17:20:02-08:00","id":1003152,"title":"","content":"What's it ask?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T18:23:19-08:00","id":1003184,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1002927-survey-from-white-wolf?p=1003152#post1003152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What's it ask?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> General survey about what type of role-playing you do(table top, LARP, etc.), how much money you generally spend on role-playing games per month, how much you play, how you like to receive your gaming news, etc.<br /> <br /> Also, a number of questions focusing specifically on VtM(what clans you play) and WtA, as well as a number of questions focused on previous World of Darkness videogames.<br /> <br /> Was very happy to see Hunter the Reckoning, even though I guess it kinda has to be mentioned when discussing their previous videogames.<br /> <br /> Hunter the Reckoning is what got me into the World of Darkness. Still a favorite of mine to this day, and I'd love to see Paradox Wolf do something with the property.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T18:53:04-08:00","id":1003193,"title":"","content":"Just finished answering it and came here to see if anybody started a thread and creating one if not. I think it's a very good step from them. Asking the fanbase about what they want to see in the future usually paid off. I'd like to ask everyone here to subscribe the newsletter in their website and taking the survey, because I think communicating and feedback is very important. I' applauding it when OP, or Paizo, or WotC does it and applauding it if WWP go that route.<br /> <br /> Also, please spread the word in the various community pages because I think there's a lot of WoD fans who doesn't know about the new website, the newsletter and this survey.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If nothing worked, then let's think!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6363-pm\u00e1rk","name":"PM\u00e1rk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2363"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-14T21:45:08-08:00","id":1003243,"title":"","content":"Where is this survey coming from? I'd love to respond to it... but I don't seem to be in whichever loop they're sending it through.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T08:28:04-08:00","id":1003412,"title":"","content":"Agreed. I want one. I need to shout my opinions at them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Signatures are for terrible people who want to be caught.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12414-flower-innocent","name":"Flower,Innocent","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T10:30:19-08:00","id":1003470,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1002927-survey-from-white-wolf?p=1003243#post1003243\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where is this survey coming from? I'd love to respond to it... but I don't seem to be in whichever loop they're sending it through.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am subscribed to the newsletter on the website and I got the survey's link in email (gmail put it in promotions). They are also reachable directly via <a href=\"/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#640d0a020b24130c0d100149130b08024a070b09\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"b7ded9d1d8f7c0dfdec3d29ac0d8dbd199d4d8da\">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>. I don't know if you'll get the survey if subscribing later.<br /> <br /> It might worth suggesting to them in a letter to submitting this and any future surveys directly through the website/fb/etc. to reach a bigger audience.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flower,Innocent</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1002927-survey-from-white-wolf?p=1003412#post1003412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Agreed. I want one. I need to shout my opinions at them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Umm, I don't know. I have rather strong opinions and feelings about a lot of things, but &quot;shouting at them&quot; doesn't seems to be the most constructive and mature course of action. I think giving polite feedback is generally better. Remember, they're persons too. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If nothing worked, then let's think!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6363-pm\u00e1rk","name":"PM\u00e1rk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2363"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-15T12:19:17-08:00","id":1003533,"title":"","content":"I get that it's a little harder to determine tone on the internet. But...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Signatures are for terrible people who want to be caught.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":